              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Nyasaye wanje, ekhusaayile mbu bulaano tsimonitsio tsitimbushe, amarwiko nikarechelesia tsisaala etsilasaayilungwa habundu hano.",
          "type": "text",
